/// - fullscreen:
///   - call `AddFullscreenScene` with the chosen widget manifest UID
/// ```text
/// - creates scene with single fullscreen widget (with manifest defaults
///   unless overridden in `params`)
/// - response contains ID of newly created scene
/// ```
